%description:
Tests TCP Fast Open with a forked server (listen()). The listener forks a
connection for the Fast Open SYN of connection 2 (with the cookie and 200
bytes), and the application gets the connection at once (TCP_I_AVAILABLE,
RFC 7413 section 4.2.2, step 4), before the SYN-ACK goes out. It accepts the
connection, and gets TCP_I_ESTABLISHED and the 200 bytes. The ACK of the
SYN-ACK gives no second indication. The SYN-ACK advertises a window less the
200 bytes, which the application did not read yet.
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.fastOpen=true
*.cli_app.tOpen2=0.5s
*.cli_app.active2=true
*.cli_app.localPort2=1001
*.cli_app.tSend2=0.5s
*.cli_app.sendBytes2=200B
*.cli_app.fastOpen2=true

*.srv_app.fork=true
*.srv_app.logIndications=true
*.cli_tcp.fastopenClientEnabled = true
*.srv_tcp.fastopenServerEnabled = true

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
srv_app: TCP_I_AVAILABLE
srv_app: TCP_I_ESTABLISHED
srv_app: TCP_I_DATA, 200 bytes
[0.503 B002] A.1001 < B.2000: A S 125500:125500(0) ack 125201 win 16184   Option(s): MaxSegSize
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.505 A004] A.1001 > B.2000: A ack 125501 win 16384 
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_ACK)
[0.506] tcpdump finished, A:4 B:2 segments
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
TcpTestNet1.srv_app: received 200 bytes in 1 packets
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
